# Web server rules for the Prunel website (https://gazebar.kopol.xyz).
#
# The OVH hosting copies the whole repository from GitHub, but only the website/
# folder is the site: every address is served from website/, so the rest of the
# repository (code, .git) is never shown. This file has no effect on Prunel itself.

DirectoryIndex index.html
Options -Indexes

RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} !^/website/
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ website/$1 [L]
